   "source": "<a id=\"scratch-data\"></a>\n### 2.2 数据准备：一维非线性带噪数据\n\n本节用一维非线性目标演示梯度提升的“逐步纠错”：\n\n$$\ny=\\sin(2.2x)+0.25x+\\varepsilon,\n\\qquad\n\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,0.2^2)\n$$\n\n\\(x\\) 从 \\([-3,3]\\) 均匀采样，共 160 个样本，固定随机种子为 42，\n按 80%/20% 划分。一维数据可以清楚看到每一轮树桩在拟合什么残差。"
  },
  {
   "id": "e5628212cbdc441cb7598a1d8b63a4bf",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.548558Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.548848Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.557513Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.558476Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": "训练集样本数: 128\n测试集样本数: 32\n"
    }
   ],
   "source": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nmanual_x = rng.uniform(-3, 3, 160)\nmanual_y = (\n    np.sin(2.2 * manual_x)\n    + 0.25 * manual_x\n    + rng.normal(0, 0.2, 160)\n)\n\nindices = rng.permutation(len(manual_x))\nsplit = int(0.8 * len(manual_x))\ntrain_idx, test_idx = indices[:split], indices[split:]\n\nmanual_X_train = manual_x[train_idx]\nmanual_X_test = manual_x[test_idx]\nmanual_y_train = manual_y[train_idx]\nmanual_y_test = manual_y[test_idx]\n\nprint(f\"训练集样本数: {len(manual_y_train)}\")\nprint(f\"测试集样本数: {len(manual_y_test)}\")"
  },
  {
   "id": "806778755b214ce48815999b6cbcf639",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"stump\"></a>\n### 2.3 模型实现：`DecisionStumpRegressor`\n\n树桩（stump）是只有一次分裂的决策树：找一个阈值把样本分成左右两段，\n每段输出该段标签均值。它是 GBDT 最小的“弱学习器”。"
  },
  {
   "id": "8c366ee8f5504eacb6885fae2f8ba28e",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.561149Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.561402Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.566526Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.567805Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": "class DecisionStumpRegressor:\n    '''一维单分裂点回归树桩：输出左右两段均值。'''\n\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.threshold_ = None\n        self.left_value_ = None\n        self.right_value_ = None\n\n    def fit(self, x, y):\n        x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float).ravel()\n        y = np.asarray(y, dtype=float)\n        best = None\n        for threshold in np.unique(x)[:-1]:\n            mask = x <= threshold\n            if mask.all() or (~mask).all():\n                continue\n            left_value = y[mask].mean()\n            right_value = y[~mask].mean()\n            squared_error = (\n                ((y[mask] - left_value) ** 2).sum()\n                + ((y[~mask] - right_value) ** 2).sum()\n            )\n            if best is None or squared_error < best[0]:\n                best = (\n                    squared_error,\n                    threshold,\n                    left_value,\n                    right_value,\n                )\n        self.threshold_, self.left_value_, self.right_value_ = best[1:]\n        return self\n\n    def predict(self, x):\n        x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float).ravel()\n        return np.where(\n            x <= self.threshold_,\n            self.left_value_,\n            self.right_value_,\n        )"
  },
  {
   "id": "7d13ce51cfae44619b44056849602571",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": "<a id=\"gbdt-scratch\"></a>\n### 2.4 模型实现：`GBDTRegressorScratch`\n\n`fit` 按 1.5 节的公式迭代：每轮用当前残差训练一个树桩，把树桩预测乘以\n学习率后从残差中扣除；`predict` 把每个树桩的收缩预测累加起来。"
  },
  {
   "id": "bb911325103948e2a978b16f093ded7c",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.569995Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.570292Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.574942Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T07:41:59.575976Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": "class GBDTRegressorScratch:\n    '''用决策树桩拟合残差的梯度提升回归器（教学版）。'''\n\n    def __init__(self, n_estimators=150, learning_rate=0.1):\n        self.n_estimators = n_estimators\n        self.learning_rate = learning_rate\n\n    def fit(self, x, y):\n        x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float).ravel()\n        y = np.asarray(y, dtype=float)\n        self.models_ = []\n        self.train_loss_history_ = []\n        residual = y.copy()\n        for _ in range(self.n_estimators):\n            self.train_loss_history_.append(\n                np.mean(residual ** 2)\n            )\n            stump = DecisionStumpRegressor().fit(\n                x,\n                residual,\n            )\n            self.models_.append(stump)\n            residual = residual - (\n                self.learning_rate * stump.predict(x)\n            )\n        return self\n\n    def predict(self, x):\n        x = np.asarray(x, dtype=float).ravel()\n        prediction = np.zeros_like(x)\n        for stump in self.models_:\n            prediction += (\n                self.learning_rate * stump.predict(x)\n            )\n        return prediction"
  },
  {
